.TH MINTDRIVERS-QT 1 "October 2026" "mintdrivers" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mintdrivers-qt \- preview driver choices in the experimental Qt interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mintdrivers-qt
.RI [ test ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists additional drivers using the shared driver detection backend.
Driver selections produce a read-only preview of planned package changes.
The interface does not install or remove packages.
PackageKit execution is not enabled in this frontend.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B test
Include fictitious devices for inspecting driver choices and plan previews.
Fictitious plans cannot be executed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mintdrivers (1)
.SH AUTHORS
Derived from Linux Mint Driver Manager, with the experimental Qt frontend
maintained by Mainuan.
